; SPINNING CUBE - assembly for the custom CPU emulator
; Assumes the 64x48 screen from Example2.txt.
; Five precomputed wireframe views rotate continuously around an oblique axis.
; All pixels are written by CPU instructions: LDI/ADDI set VRAM address, VSTI writes color.
; Edge colors use palette indices: cyan=5, white=1, blue=6; black background=0.
; Jump operands are absolute ROM cell addresses (3 cells per instruction).
; No labels are used because Compiler.py compiles mnemonic tokens, not labels.
;
